WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.950
[Keyboard tapping; tense music]

00:01.950 --> 00:05.500
Daughter: Mom, can you run lines with me, please?

00:05.500 --> 00:08.700
[Notifications and sign-in codes pile up]

00:08.730 --> 00:11.580
Husband: Hey, did I remember your mom's birthday?

00:11.700 --> 00:16.350
[Work chatter and notifications build]

00:16.700 --> 00:21.700
[Birdsong, gentle water and soft piano]

00:23.300 --> 00:27.300
Narrator: What if there was a better way?

00:28.700 --> 00:33.000
[Upbeat music]

00:49.100 --> 00:51.250
Narrator: Ready to give your day back?

00:51.250 --> 00:54.700
Book 30 minutes at animoplatform.net.
